                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} q:\mathrm{Id}_{A, B}(e, x, y)
              we have a type
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
